e":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":500,"text":"neu beginnen / ändern","textFontFamily":"Abel","attachedFrame":"Mj5rpqPEhaLtrADqHDjCg","textAlignment":"left","textSize":48},{"id":"TFiEf2z2fbgku7FmRnAvb","fillColor":"transparent","height":80,"position":{"x":10220,"y":5820},"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":300,"text":"Risiken","textFontFamily":"Abel","attachedFrame":"Mj5rpqPEhaLtrADqHDjCg","textAlignment":"right","textSize":48},{"id":"7YKj9GF1BfUO5lUVrrzXs","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":10720,"y":4860},"width":1720,"height":120,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Methodenbeschreibung","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"SM05qVI41n-9zLPV5MJtn","textSize":56,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"UmJlZHwONkwduP4ob7YPk","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":10740,"y":5030},"width":1680,"height":930,"fillColor":"transparent","text":"🚀 Wo stehen wir? Der Ablauf in 4 Schritten\n\n🎯 Wofür: Den aktuellen Stand einer Zusammenarbeit oder eines Projekts ehrlich einschätzen.\n\n1. Einführen (2 Min.)\nAktion: Erklären Sie die vier Felder:\nweiter so – was funktioniert und soll bleiben?\nlieber lassen – was kostet Kraft ohne Nutzen?\nneu beginnen / ändern – was fehlt oder muss anders werden?\nRisiken – was könnte uns gefährden?\n\n2. Sammeln (10 Min.)\nAktion: Jeder schreibt Karten und legt sie in die Felder.\nRegel: Konkrete Beispiele statt allgemeiner Urteile.\n\n3. Besprechen (15–20 Min.)\nAktion: Gehen Sie Feld für Feld durch, clustern Sie Ähnliches und klären Sie Unklares.\n\n4. Überleiten (5 Min.)\nAktion: Markieren Sie die Karten, die in die Priorisierung gehen (nächster Rahmen).\n\n🛠️ Ihre Rolle als Moderator\nFairness-Hüter: Achten Sie darauf, dass beide Seiten zu Wort kommen.\nRisiko-Lotse: Nehmen Sie Risiken ernst, ohne in Problemlösung abzudriften.\nZeitwächter: Halten Sie das Besprechen knapp.","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"SM05qVI41n-9zLPV5MJtn","textSize":24,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"nirz7cKiy6NXcQLOo-k-Y","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":4860},"width":1920,"height":120,"fillColor":"#ff5722","text":"METADATEN · T19 · wird vor Veröffentlichung entfernt","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"NdQy-BFPTokS07IzLlJSN","textSize":44,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"KSc1XcbZ-82bbc3HqDy47","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":5000},"width":1920,"height":130,"fillColor":"transparent","text":"Template-ID: T19   ·   Datei: T19_where-do-we-stand.de.nwb   ·   Board-Format: v2 (Infinite Canvas)\nQuelle: Kooperationsaustausch.nwb › Rahmen 3\nAusfüllen: In „Ihr Eintrag\" eigenen Text schreiben oder ✓ setzen, um den Vorschlag zu übernehmen. Leer = noch offen.","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"NdQy-BFPTokS07IzLlJSN","textSize":22,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"UycVyligL7kwf0GyqOO1B","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":5150},"width":430,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Feld","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"NdQy-BFPTokS07IzLlJSN","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"MEY4FCWKqeWbfzy8OBQO6","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13090,"y":5150},"width":690,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Vorschlag","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"NdQy-BFPTokS07IzLlJSN","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"vmhfhjvbKt3y3hPliU5jy","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":13800,"y":5150},"width":760,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Ihr Eintrag","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"NdQy-BFPTokS07IzLlJSN","textSize":24,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"WlbS4YmJfkYMsVgdgTuMq","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":5218},"width":430,"height":93,"fillColor":"#d7dee2","text":"Veröffentlichen?\n[publish]","te